<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Metrogas year net 38.0 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Metrogas year net 38.0 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Dec 31</p>
<p>Net 38.0 million pesos vs n/a.</p>
<p>Net assets 611.2 million pesos.</p>
<p>NOTE: Metrogas, which is operated by British Gas Plc, is the largest of the eight Argentine gas distribution companies. No other financial details were available.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
</text>
